    <section class="hero" id="top"><div class="wrap hero-grid"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Company stores for promo distributors</p><h1>Your next client store.<br><em>Make it their <br>favorite place to order.</em></h1><p class="intro">We design, launch and manage branded Shopify company stores. You bring the client and the merchandise. We bring the experience.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button primary" href="/book-demo/?service=company-store-launch&amp;intent=launch">Book a demo<svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow-up-right"></use></svg></a><a class="quiet-link" href="#experience">Explore the experience <svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow-right"></use></svg></a><span class="demo-launch"><a class="button secondary" href="https://client-demo-store-zxcpnca3.myshopify.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">See demo <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-monitor"></use></svg></a><span class="store-password"><span>Store password: <strong>1</strong></span><button type="button" class="store-password__copy" data-copy-password="1" aria-label="Copy store password">Copy</button></span></span></div><div class="hero-notes"><span><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-palette"></use></svg>Their brand.</span><span><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-shield-check"></use></svg>Your client relationship.</span></div></div><div class="hero-stage"><div class="browser hero-product"><div class="browser-chrome"><span><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><small>PRODUCT ORDERING / ACTUAL DEMO</small><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-monitor"></use></svg></div><img src="/assets/company-store/product-ordering.webp" srcset="/assets/company-store/product-ordering-768.webp 768w, /assets/company-store/product-ordering.webp 1348w" sizes="(max-width:600px) 92vw, (max-width:850px) 535px, 600px" alt="Actual demo product-ordering page with merchandise options" width="1348" height="926" decoding="async" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high"></div><div class="browser hero-home"><div class="browser-chrome"><span><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><small>BRANDED STOREFRONT / ACTUAL DEMO</small><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-monitor"></use></svg></div><img src="/assets/company-store/branded-storefront.webp" srcset="/assets/company-store/branded-storefront-768.webp 768w, /assets/company-store/branded-storefront.webp 1348w" sizes="(max-width:600px) 69vw, 410px" alt="Actual demo company-store homepage" width="1348" height="926" decoding="async" loading="eager"></div><div class="stage-caption"><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-mouse-pointer-2"></use></svg>A real company store. Built by Swishtag.</div></div></div></section>
