  <div class="company-store">
    <section class="section editorial-section" id="problem" data-nav-label="Real problem"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">The real problem</p><h2>The first order happens.<br>What about the next one?</h2></div><p>Most company store opportunities lose momentum when reordering becomes too slow, too manual or too difficult to repeat.</p></div><div class="editorial-grid three"><article class="editorial-card"><span class="number">01</span><h3>The program goes quiet.</h3><p>You complete the initial project, but there is no simple buying experience that keeps the client coming back.</p></article><article class="editorial-card"><span class="number">02</span><h3>Every reorder needs another conversation.</h3><p>Sizes, quantities, addresses, artwork and payment details are collected manually each time.</p></article><article class="editorial-card"><span class="number">03</span><h3>A competitor looks more prepared.</h3><p>When a client asks for an online company store, a slow or unclear response can cost you the opportunity.</p></article></div><p class="section-note">You already know how to supply the products. Give your client an easier way to order them again.</p></div></section><section class="section value-section" id="solution" data-nav-label="Solution"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">The solution, simply</p><h2>You sell the program.<br>We make the store happen.</h2></div><p>Say yes to your next company-store opportunity without becoming a Shopify development team.</p></div><div class="value-columns"><article><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-palette"></use></svg><h3>Their brand. Your expertise.</h3><p>A company store that feels like your client, with your merchandise and pricing.</p></article><article><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-shopping-bag"></use></svg><h3>Better ordering. Less chasing.</h3><p>Collect product choices, sizes and order details in one shopping experience.</p></article><article><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-headphones"></use></svg><h3>A launch. And a partner.</h3><p>We build the store, then help keep it current through ongoing Care.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="section editorial-section" id="use-cases" data-nav-label="Use cases"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Built for real client programs</p><h2>One store.<br>Many reasons to return.</h2></div><p>Build the store around the way your client orders, from everyday essentials to a focused campaign.</p></div><div class="editorial-grid three"><article class="editorial-card"><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-users"></use></svg><h3>Employee merchandise</h3><p>Keep approved branded products available year round, using stocked inventory, print on demand or both.</p></article><article class="editorial-card"><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-shopping-bag"></use></svg><h3>New hire kits</h3><p>Bring welcome merchandise, onboarding items and delivery details into one ordering experience.</p></article><article class="editorial-card"><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-rocket"></use></svg><h3>Events and campaigns</h3><p>Create a temporary collection, preorder program or ongoing store for a company initiative.</p></article><article class="editorial-card"><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-shield-check"></use></svg><h3>Recognition and incentives</h3><p>Give teams access to approved rewards, sales incentives and milestone merchandise.</p></article><article class="editorial-card"><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-layers"></use></svg><h3>Location ordering</h3><p>Roll out the approved store template for branches, franchises or locations. Template clones start at $300 each.</p></article><article class="editorial-card"><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-settings-2"></use></svg><h3>Ongoing merchandise programs</h3><p>Keep core products available while introducing seasonal collections and new campaign merchandise.</p></article></div></div></section><section class="section experience-section" id="experience" data-nav-label="See demo"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">See the experience</p><h2>One store.<br>Every detail considered.</h2></div><p>See how branding, product choices and approved artwork come together in our actual demo.</p></div><div class="screen-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Choose a store screen"><button class="screen-tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" id="tab-home" aria-controls="screen-panel" data-screen="home"><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-monitor"></use></svg><span>Storefront</span></button><button class="screen-tab" role="tab" aria-selected="true" id="tab-product" aria-controls="screen-panel" data-screen="product"><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-shopping-bag"></use></svg><span>Product ordering</span></button><button class="screen-tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" id="tab-personalization" aria-controls="screen-panel" data-screen="personalization"><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-palette"></use></svg><span>Personalization</span></button></div><div class="screen-panel" id="screen-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-product"><div class="screen-stage"><div class="browser "><div class="browser-chrome"><span><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><small>NORTHSTAR / PRODUCT EXPERIENCE</small><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-monitor"></use></svg></div><img src="/assets/company-store/product-ordering.webp" srcset="/assets/company-store/product-ordering-768.webp 768w, /assets/company-store/product-ordering.webp 1348w" sizes="(max-width:850px) calc(100vw - 40px), 740px" alt="Actual demo product page showing clear product choices" width="1348" height="926" decoding="async" loading="lazy"></div><span class="actual-label">Actual Swishtag demo store</span></div><div class="screen-copy"><span class="eyebrow" id="screen-eyebrow">02 / Made for ordering</span><h3 id="screen-title">Make choosing easy.<br>Keep the details together.</h3><p id="screen-description">Clear product information, colors, sizes and ordering options in one considered product page.</p><ul class="list" id="screen-features"><li><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-circle-check"></use></svg><span>Color and size choices</span></li><li><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-circle-check"></use></svg><span>Individual and multi-size ordering</span></li><li><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-circle-check"></use></svg><span>A clear next step to checkout</span></li></ul><div class="cta-row"><span class="demo-launch"><a class="button secondary" href="https://client-demo-store-zxcpnca3.myshopify.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">See demo <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-monitor"></use></svg></a><span class="store-password"><span>Store password: <strong>1</strong></span><button type="button" class="store-password__copy" data-copy-password="1" aria-label="Copy store password">Copy</button></span></span><a class="button primary" href="/book-demo/?service=company-store-launch&amp;intent=store-experience">Book a demo<svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow-up-right"></use></svg></a></div><small>Demo features shown. Your store is configured to the agreed scope.</small></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section concepts-section motion-region" id="possibilities"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Different clients. Different possibilities.</p><h2>A company store should<br>feel like <em>their company.</em></h2></div><div><p>From everyday team ordering to a focused client campaign. We shape the store around the program.</p><button class="motion-toggle" aria-label="Pause store concepts" aria-pressed="false"><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-pause"></use></svg><span>Pause motion</span></button></div></div></div><div class="concepts-viewport"><div class="concept-track"><div class="concept-group"><article class="concept-slide"><div class="concept-browser"><div class="browser-chrome"><span><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><small>ATLAS / DESIGN STUDY</small><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-monitor"></use></svg></div><img src="/assets/company-store/atlas-design-study.webp" srcset="/assets/company-store/atlas-design-study-768.webp 768w, /assets/company-store/atlas-design-study.webp 1120w" sizes="(max-width:600px) 88vw, 520px" alt="Atlas illustrative company-store design: An established team store" width="1120" height="770" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><div class="concept-caption"><h3>An established team store</h3><p>A complete branded storefront, with collections and a clear buying journey.</p></div></article><article class="concept-slide"><div class="concept-browser"><div class="browser-chrome"><span><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><small>MERIDIAN / DESIGN STUDY</small><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-monitor"></use></svg></div><img src="/assets/company-store/meridian-design-study.webp" srcset="/assets/company-store/meridian-design-study-768.webp 768w, /assets/company-store/meridian-design-study.webp 1120w" sizes="(max-width:600px) 88vw, 520px" alt="Meridian illustrative company-store design: A considered welcome experience" width="1120" height="770" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><div class="concept-caption"><h3>A considered welcome experience</h3><p>A focused onboarding store that feels part of the client’s company.</p></div></article><article class="concept-slide"><div class="concept-browser"><div class="browser-chrome"><span><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><small>FIELDWORK / DESIGN STUDY</small><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-monitor"></use></svg></div><img src="/assets/company-store/fieldwork-design-study.webp" srcset="/assets/company-store/fieldwork-design-study-768.webp 768w, /assets/company-store/fieldwork-design-study.webp 1120w" sizes="(max-width:600px) 88vw, 520px" alt="Fieldwork illustrative company-store design: An easier way to personalize" width="1120" height="770" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><div class="concept-caption"><h3>An easier way to personalize</h3><p>A product page with sizes, approved artwork and clear ordering choices.</p></div></article></div><div class="concept-group" aria-hidden="true" inert><article class="concept-slide"><div class="concept-browser"><div class="browser-chrome"><span><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><small>ATLAS / DESIGN STUDY</small><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-monitor"></use></svg></div><img src="/assets/company-store/atlas-design-study.webp" srcset="/assets/company-store/atlas-design-study-768.webp 768w, /assets/company-store/atlas-design-study.webp 1120w" sizes="(max-width:600px) 88vw, 520px" alt="Atlas illustrative company-store design: An established team store" width="1120" height="770" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><div class="concept-caption"><h3>An established team store</h3><p>A complete branded storefront, with collections and a clear buying journey.</p></div></article><article class="concept-slide"><div class="concept-browser"><div class="browser-chrome"><span><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><small>MERIDIAN / DESIGN STUDY</small><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-monitor"></use></svg></div><img src="/assets/company-store/meridian-design-study.webp" srcset="/assets/company-store/meridian-design-study-768.webp 768w, /assets/company-store/meridian-design-study.webp 1120w" sizes="(max-width:600px) 88vw, 520px" alt="Meridian illustrative company-store design: A considered welcome experience" width="1120" height="770" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><div class="concept-caption"><h3>A considered welcome experience</h3><p>A focused onboarding store that feels part of the client’s company.</p></div></article><article class="concept-slide"><div class="concept-browser"><div class="browser-chrome"><span><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><small>FIELDWORK / DESIGN STUDY</small><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-monitor"></use></svg></div><img src="/assets/company-store/fieldwork-design-study.webp" srcset="/assets/company-store/fieldwork-design-study-768.webp 768w, /assets/company-store/fieldwork-design-study.webp 1120w" sizes="(max-width:600px) 88vw, 520px" alt="Fieldwork illustrative company-store design: An easier way to personalize" width="1120" height="770" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><div class="concept-caption"><h3>An easier way to personalize</h3><p>A product page with sizes, approved artwork and clear ordering choices.</p></div></article></div></div></div><div class="wrap concept-footer"><span>Illustrative design directions · Built around each client’s scope</span><a class="button primary" href="/book-demo/?service=company-store-launch&amp;intent=store-concepts">Book a demo<svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow-up-right"></use></svg></a></div></section>
<section class="section pricing-section" id="pricing" data-nav-label="Pricing"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Clear setup. Ongoing care.</p><h2>Start with one.<br>Build your next opportunity.</h2></div><p>One-time store setup, with monthly Care and Rocket Apps. Shopify and external services are paid separately.</p></div><div class="plans"><article class="plan"><span class="plan-label"><span>01 / BUILD</span><span class="plan-symbol"><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-shopping-bag"></use></svg></span></span><h3>First company store</h3><p class="plan-description">A branded Shopify store for one client program.</p><div class="plan-price">$1,200<small>One-time setup</small></div><p class="plan-rule">Plus $100/month Care per store</p><ul class="list"><li><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-check"></use></svg><span>Client-branded design + mobile layout</span></li><li><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-check"></use></svg><span>Up to 50 products + 50 logo mockups</span></li><li><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-check"></use></svg><span>Payments, shipping + launch setup</span></li><li><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-check"></use></svg><span>Preview in 5 business days*</span></li></ul><a class="button primary" href="/book-demo/?service=company-store-launch&amp;intent=first-store">Book a demo<svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow-up-right"></use></svg></a></article><article class="plan"><span class="plan-label"><span>02 / EXPAND</span><span class="plan-symbol"><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-layers"></use></svg></span></span><h3>Additional store</h3><p class="plan-description">Launch another store from your approved template.</p><div class="plan-price">$300<small>One-time, per additional store</small></div><p class="plan-rule">Plus $100/month Care + Rocket Apps</p><ul class="list"><li><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-check"></use></svg><span>Reuse the approved design + structure</span></li><li><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-check"></use></svg><span>New location or program configuration</span></li><li><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-check"></use></svg><span>Store setup + launch checks</span></li><li><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-check"></use></svg><span>Typical rollout: 2–3 business days*</span></li></ul><a class="button primary" href="/book-demo/?service=company-store-launch&amp;intent=additional-store">Book a demo<svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow-up-right"></use></svg></a></article><article class="plan"><span class="plan-label"><span>03 / SUPPORT</span><span class="plan-symbol"><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-headphones"></use></svg></span></span><h3>Care + Rocket Apps</h3><p class="plan-description">Ongoing help for your first store and every rollout.</p><div class="plan-price">$100<small>Per month, per store</small></div><p class="plan-rule">Cancel anytime · External services separate</p><ul class="list"><li><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-check"></use></svg><span>Agreed Rocket Apps package + setup</span></li><li><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-check"></use></svg><span>Routine product, price + banner updates</span></li><li><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-check"></use></svg><span>Theme + app maintenance and fixes</span></li><li><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-check"></use></svg><span>Support response within 1 business day</span></li></ul><a class="button primary" href="/book-demo/?service=company-store-launch&amp;intent=care">Book a demo<svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow-up-right"></use></svg></a></article></div><div class="pricing-details"><div class="payment-note"><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-circle-check"></use></svg><p><strong>50% to start. 50% at launch.</strong> Pay by card. See your store design within 5 business days of complete content and deposit. If you don’t love the design, we refund your full deposit.</p></div><p class="section-note cost-note">Shopify is billed separately. Any paid Shopify add-on app costs extra according to the app’s selected pricing plan. <a href="#care">See Care features and separate costs <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow-right"></use></svg></a></p><details><summary>See package boundaries <svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-plus"></use></svg></summary><p>First store: 50% deposit and 50% at launch. Additional stores reuse an approved template; different branding or custom layouts use the first-store package. Care covers routine updates, not new builds, large catalog loads or custom integrations. Merchandise, production, fulfillment, shipping, Shopify and external services are separate. *Timelines start with complete content and the deposit. The proposal confirms scope.</p></details></div></div></section>
<section class="section care-section" id="care" data-nav-label="Care features"><div class="wrap care-layout"><div><p class="eyebrow">More than launch day</p><h2>Keep the store fresh.<br><em>Keep your team focused.</em></h2><p class="intro">For $100 a month per store, Care combines routine store support with your agreed Rocket Apps package. Keep products current, ordering tools available and your team focused on the client.</p><a class="button primary" href="/book-demo/?service=company-store-launch&amp;intent=care-plan">Book a demo<svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow-up-right"></use></svg></a></div><div class="care-services"><article><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-settings-2"></use></svg><div><h3>Updates, handled.</h3><p>Routine product and price updates, banners and seasonal changes keep the store relevant.</p></div></article><article><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-rocket"></use></svg><div><h3>Ordering tools, together.</h3><p>Employee login, allowances, quotes, bulk orders, shared carts, address validation, forms and announcements. The proposal confirms the apps and configuration included for your program.</p></div></article><article><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-headphones"></use></svg><div><h3>A team to turn to.</h3><p>App and theme updates, fixes and monitoring, with a support response within 1 business day.</p></div></article><p class="care-footnote">One Care Plan per store. Cancel anytime. Care services and subscription-based Rocket Apps access require an active subscription. New custom features, new builds, large catalog loads and custom integrations are quoted separately.</p></div></div><div class="wrap separate-costs"><p class="eyebrow">Paid separately</p><h3>Know what sits outside the package.</h3><div class="editorial-grid two"><div><strong>Your Shopify subscription</strong><p>Paid directly to Shopify at the price of your chosen Shopify plan. Merchandise, production, fulfillment and shipping are separate.</p></div><div><strong>Paid add-on apps</strong><p>If a paid Shopify add-on app is added, its subscription or usage fees are extra, according to that app’s selected pricing plan on Shopify. Third-party apps are separate from the agreed Rocket Apps package.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section editorial-section" id="included" data-nav-label="What’s included"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">What’s included</p><h2>Everything for your<br>first company store.</h2></div><p>Your $1,200 setup covers one branded company store program, from product preparation to launch.</p></div><div class="editorial-grid four"><article class="editorial-card"><span class="number">01</span><h3>Storefront setup</h3><ul class="list"><li><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-circle-check"></use></svg><span>Client-branded, mobile-friendly Shopify store</span></li><li><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-circle-check"></use></svg><span>Payments and shipping setup</span></li><li><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-circle-check"></use></svg><span>Employee login configuration, if required</span></li></ul></article><article class="editorial-card"><span class="number">02</span><h3>Catalog setup</h3><ul class="list"><li><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-circle-check"></use></svg><span>Up to 50 newly prepared products</span></li><li><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-circle-check"></use></svg><span>Titles, descriptions and supplied photos</span></li><li><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-circle-check"></use></svg><span>All colors and sizes, with your pricing and margin</span></li></ul></article><article class="editorial-card"><span class="number">03</span><h3>Logo mockups</h3><ul class="list"><li><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-circle-check"></use></svg><span>Up to 50 logo mockups</span></li><li><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-circle-check"></use></svg><span>One logo, up to 2 placements per product</span></li><li><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-circle-check"></use></svg><span>One revision round</span></li></ul></article><article class="editorial-card"><span class="number">04</span><h3>Preview and launch</h3><ul class="list"><li><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-circle-check"></use></svg><span>Design preview within 5 business days</span></li><li><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-circle-check"></use></svg><span>Launch in about 10 business days after complete content</span></li><li><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-circle-check"></use></svg><span>Your own Shopify account, store and data</span></li></ul></article></div><p class="section-note">One product means one style with all its colors and sizes. Additional new product setup: $100 per 25 products. Standard migration is also included within the limits below.</p></div></section><section class="section editorial-section" id="migration" data-nav-label="Migration"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Free standard migration</p><h2>A fresh start.<br>Without starting from zero.</h2></div><p>Moving from Magento or another platform? Standard migration is included with your first store, subject to a source-data review.</p></div><div class="editorial-grid two"><article class="editorial-card"><h3>Included in the move</h3><ul class="list"><li><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-circle-check"></use></svg><span>Up to 250 migrated products</span></li><li><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-circle-check"></use></svg><span>Up to 1,000 customer accounts</span></li><li><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-circle-check"></use></svg><span>12 months of read-only order history</span></li><li><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-circle-check"></use></svg><span>Up to 100 URL redirects</span></li></ul></article><article class="editorial-card"><h3>Scoped separately</h3><ul class="list"><li><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-circle-check"></use></svg><span>Custom extensions and ERP integrations</span></li><li><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-circle-check"></use></svg><span>Multi-store or multilingual setups</span></li><li><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-circle-check"></use></svg><span>Manual data cleanup</span></li></ul></article></div><p class="section-note">Migrated records are separate from the 50 newly prepared products and mockups. Above 250 migrated products: $100 per 250 additional products.</p></div></section><section class="section launch-section" id="launch" data-nav-label="Process"><div class="wrap launch-layout"><div><p class="eyebrow">From opportunity to open store</p><h2>A clear path <br>to launch.</h2><p class="intro">A scope you understand.<br>A preview before you commit to launch.</p><a class="button primary" href="/book-demo/?service=company-store-launch&amp;intent=launch-process">Book a demo<svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow-up-right"></use></svg></a></div><ol class="launch-steps"><li><span class="step-icon"><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-users"></use></svg></span><div><span class="step-label">01 / DISCOVER</span><h3>Book a 15-minute demo.</h3><p>We review your client, products and ordering needs, then confirm the package and scope.</p></div></li><li><span class="step-icon"><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-clipboard-check"></use></svg></span><div><span class="step-label">02 / DEFINE</span><h3>Pay the deposit. Share the content.</h3><p>Pay 50% by card and send your logo, product list, images and prices. The build clock starts once the deposit and complete content are received.</p></div></li><li><span class="step-icon"><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-monitor"></use></svg></span><div><span class="step-label">03 / PREVIEW</span><h3>Your preview, within 5 business days.</h3><p>Review the branded design before launch. If you don’t love it, we refund your full deposit.</p></div></li><li><span class="step-icon"><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-rocket"></use></svg></span><div><span class="step-label">04 / LAUNCH + CARE</span><h3>Launch in about 10 business days.</h3><p>Complete the launch checks and pay the final 50%. Template clones typically launch in 2–3 business days, then each store continues with its own Care Plan.</p></div></li></ol></div><div class="wrap launch-reassurance"><span><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-shield-check"></use></svg>Your Shopify account. Your store and data.</span><span><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-monitor"></use></svg>Design preview within 5 business days of complete content.</span></div></section>
